{"sha": "6a3615947e233ee5730b50cd4f10190a64edbb98adf799212bbc347de46229f3", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:thermal-radiation} 章 --- 热辐射}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:1}", "$\\lambda_{\\max}$: \\qty{0.50}{\\micro m}, \\qty{9.4}{\\micro m}, \\qty{1.04}{\\micro m},", "\\qty{1.06}{mm}, \\qty{38}{\\micro m}, \\qty{3.2}{\\micro m}; $\\sigma T^4$: \\qty{6.4e7}{},", "\\qty{520}{}, \\qty{3.5e6}{}, \\qty{3.1e-6}{}, \\qty{2.0}{}, \\qty{3.7e4}{W/m^2}。可见：", "太阳与灯丝；火钳发出暗红色的光，", "其短波尾部仅占其功率的万分之一。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:2}", "$S = \\sigma T_\\odot^4(R_\\odot/d)^2 = \\qty{1360}{W/m^2}$; $L = 4\\pi d^2S =", "\\qty{3.8e26}{W}$; $\\pi R^2S = \\qty{1.7e17}{W}$; \\qty{2e7}{W} 每人 --- 九", "千倍于世界的消耗量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:3}", "发出 \\qty{830}{W}，吸收 \\qty{700}{W}，净损失 \\qty{130}{W}；$h_{\\text{r}} =", "4\\varepsilon\\sigma T_0^3 = \\qty{5.6}{W/m^2/K}$。超过人体的代谢功率：", "衣物可减少这部分损失；墙壁温度为 \\qty{15}{\\celsius} 时，", "又增加约 \\qty{50}{W} 的损失 --- 人在暖空气中却身处冷墙之间，会感到寒冷。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:4}", "$A = P/\\varepsilon\\sigma T^4 = \\qty{49}{mm^2}$; $\\ell = A/\\pi d = \\qty{31}{cm}$;", "\\qty{4.8}{W} 的光；一只 \\qty{16}{W} 的发光二极管。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:5}", "(a) $\\eu^x - 1 \\approx x$：$u_\\nu = (8\\pi\\nu^2/c^3)\\,k_BT$ --- 每个模式 $k_BT$。", "(b) $\\int\\nu^2\\dd\\nu$ 发散。(c) $\\nu = k_BT/h = \\qty{6e12}{Hz}$（\\qty{50}{\\micro m}）：", "在 \\qty{300}{K} 时，无线电波与微波深处于经典区（", "电阻器噪声为每单位带宽 $k_BT$）。(d) 找到激发量子 $h\\nu$ 的概率，", "在 $T$ 下即为玻尔兹曼因子。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:6}", "(a) $x = 4.965$. (b) $hc/4.965k_B = \\qty{2.90e-3}{m.K}$. (c) $x^3/(\\eu^x - 1)$", "在 $3(1 - \\eu^{-x}) = x$ 处取峰值 $2.82$；按单位频率的", "与按单位波长的能量密度为不同的函数（$\\dd\\nu = c\\,\\dd\\lambda/\\lambda^2$），", "并在不同位置达到峰值。(d) \\qty{10000}{K}；偏蓝的白色。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:7}", "(a) $u = (8\\pi^5k_B^4/15h^3c^3)T^4$, $\\sigma = cu/4T^4 = \\qty{5.67e-8}{W/m^2/K^4}$.", "(b) 各向同性与 $\\cos\\theta$ 投影：$\\int\\cos\\theta\\,\\dd\\Omega/4\\pi = 1/4$", "对半球面积分。(c) $n = 8\\pi \\times 2.404\\,(k_BT/hc)^3 = 60.4\\,(k_BT/hc)^3$；", "平均能量 $(\\pi^4/15)/2.404 = 2.70\\,k_BT$。(d) $5 \\times 10^8$ 与 $400$", "每立方厘米。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:8}", "(a) $\\sigma(T_1^4 - T_2^4)$。(b) $T_{\\text{s}}^4 = (T_1^4 + T_2^4)/2$；减半。(c)", "$1/(n + 1)$。(d) 对各次反射求和，$\\sigma(T_1^4 - T_2^4)/(2/\\varepsilon -", "1)$；$\\varepsilon = 0.05$：$\\qty{460}{W/m^2}/39 = \\qty{12}{W/m^2}$ --- 一只表面积", "为 \\qty{0.05}{m^2} 的杜瓦瓶损失 \\qty{0.6}{W}，每天蒸发", "四分之一千克氮气。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:9}", "(a) $\\varepsilon\\sigma(T^4 - 250^4) = h(278 - T)$: $T \\approx \\qty{266}{K}$. (b)", "\\qty{277}{K}。(c) 较大的 $h$ 使地表温度紧贴气温。(d) 林冠", "温度为 \\qty{278}{K}，取代了 \\qty{250}{K} 的天空。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:10}", "(a) \\qty{231}{K}, \\qty{255}{K}, \\qty{210}{K}. (b) \\qty{506}{K}, \\qty{33}{K}, \\qty{5}{K}.", "(c) 每一不透明层均向上、向下辐射；由平衡关系给出", "$T_k^4 = (k + 1)T_{\\text{e}}^4$ 自顶层推得：对金星 $n \\approx 100$。(d)", "$((1 - A)S/\\sigma)^{1/4} = \\qty{381}{K}$；无大气时，", "热量无法输送到夜侧，月壤储热也很少：地表", "约一天之内即将白天所获热量辐射殆尽，并稳定在", "\\qty{100}{K} 附近。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:11}", "(a) $4\\sigma T_{\\text{e}}^3 = \\qty{3.8}{W/m^2/K}$. (b) \\qty{1.0}{K}. (c) $C =", "\\qty{2.1e8}{J/m^2/K}$，$\\tau = C/4\\sigma T_{\\text{e}}^3 \\approx \\qty{5.6e7}{s}$，即两", "年。(d) 变暖的空气可容纳更多水蒸气（一种温室气体），并", "使冰融化（反照率降低）：两者均会放大最初的增温。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermal-radiation:12}", "(a)", "\\[", "\\frac{M_1}{M_2} = \\Big(\\frac{\\lambda_2}{\\lambda_1}\\Big)^5\\exp\\Big[-\\frac{hc}{k_BT}\\Big(\\frac{1}{\\lambda_1} - \\frac{1}{\\lambda_2}\\Big)\\Big] :", "\\]", "$\\varepsilon$ 约去。(b) $T = \\qty{14388}{\\micro m.K} \\times 0.427/(5\\ln 1.385 +", "\\ln 10) = \\qty{1570}{K}$。(c) 接收量 $\\propto 0.1 \\times 350 + 0.9 \\times 293 =", "299$；报告值 $(299 - 0.05 \\times 293)/0.95 \\approx \\qty{299}{K}$：漏掉了", "\\qty{350}{K}。(d) 其发射率即为所假设的值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:thermal-radiation:1}", "\\textbf{1.} \\qty{5800}{K}.", "", "\\textbf{2.} \\qty{6.4e7}{W/m^2}; \\qty{3.9e26}{W}.", "", "\\textbf{3.} $L/4\\pi d^2 = \\qty{1.37e3}{W/m^2}$; $u = S/c = \\qty{4.6e-6}{J/m^3}$;", "$P = S/c = \\qty{4.6e-6}{Pa}$（若被吸收）；若被反射则为两倍。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $2.7k_BT = \\qty{2.2e-19}{J}$ (\\qty{1.35}{eV}); $6 \\times 10^{21}$", "个光子，每秒每平方米。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $3.9 \\times 10^{26} \\times 1.4 \\times 10^{17} = \\qty{5.5e43}{J}$; $Mc^2 =", "\\qty{1.8e47}{J}$：相当于其质量的万分之三。", "", "\\textbf{6.} \\qty{1.2e17}{W}; $T_{\\text{e}} = \\qty{255}{K}$.", "", "\\textbf{7.} 在 $\\pi R^2$ 上截获，经 $4\\pi R^2$ 辐射出去，借助于", "自转与风；仅就日下点而言：$((1 - A)S/\\sigma)^{1/4} =", "\\qty{360}{K}$.", ""]}